+# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
+# MYCELIUM-Accel portfolio case (2026-09-10): first-char dispatch.
+#
+# For each lexer state, precompute ordered per-first-character rule sublists:
+# a rule is excluded for character c only when its regex provably cannot
+# match any string starting with c (sound over-approximation: uncertain
+# constructs -- backrefs, categories, wide ranges -- keep the rule in every
+# list). "First matching rule in definition order wins" is preserved because
+# relative order inside each sublist never changes.
+# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
